title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/media.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our media strategy.

= Media

Use the media to drum up support for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Labour Party**</span>, quell internal disuptes, or build up the party's resources over the medium-term. 

- @guardian
- @bbc
- @labourlist
- @socialmedia
- @socialmedia_2
- @socialmedia_3
- @socialmedia_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@guardian
title: Op-ed in the Guardian
subtitle: This might upset ideological purists, but it may bring in one-off donations and win over some <span style="color: #E3B710;">Centrist Dads</span>.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10; socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 1*(1-dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent);

The piece was a success, increasing middle class support and bringing in some donations.

@bbc
title: Interview on the One Show
subtitle: Talk alotments with Matt Baker to put us in every living room in Britain.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if new_middle_conscious == 1; rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if rural_conscious == 1

This mildly improved perceptions of you and <span style="color: #c00000;">**Labour**</span> amongst pensioners.

@labourlist
title: Labourlist puff piece
subtitle: Use the party's biggest online newsite to quell dissent on the right of the party.
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; neorevisionist_dissent -= 6

The Labour Right, Blue Labour, Tribune Group and Soft Left factions are appeased.

@socialmedia
title: Building up Social Media
subtitle: Reach untapped demographics, and build up party membership.  -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: dues += 2; radio += 1; resources -= 2; unemployed_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); labor_dissent += 5; socialism += 3*(1 - dissent);  nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent) if pacifism > 1; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)

There is a rush of enthusiasm for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Labour Party**</span> online, bringing in younger voters and new members. Income from annual membership subs will increase.

@socialmedia_2
title: Continue building up social media
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: dues += 1; radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)

Our social media and new 'left media' continues to steadily build support and bring in members from untapped demographics.

@socialmedia_3
title: Continue building up social media
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 1931
on-arrival: dues += 1; radio += 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)

You continue to build support, and some new members jon. However, you are reaching the limit of new people who can be brough into the movement online.

@socialmedia_4
title: We should keep on supporting our radio network.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and (radio >= 6 or year >= 1932) and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)

You build some further support, but you have reached the limit of new members who can be brough into the movement online.
